<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Saint Louis raised at CSFB.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Saint Louis raised at CSFB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saint Louis, a French food group, was raised to &quot;buy&quot; at CS First Boston, a research note from analyst Anne Alexander at the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
